@BookingService.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5283

### 1. Health check endpoint (prerequisito 11)
GET {{BookingService.Api_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### 2. Root API status endpoint
GET {{BookingService.Api_HostAddress}}/
Accept: application/json

### 3. Swagger OpenAPI Specification
GET {{BookingService.Api_HostAddress}}/swagger/v1/swagger.json
Accept: application/json

### 4. List available seats of the event (APP-01)
GET {{BookingService.Api_HostAddress}}/events/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111/tickets
Accept: application/json

### 5. Check one seat (API-03). Replace {ticketId} with a ticketId from request 4.
@ticketId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
GET {{BookingService.Api_HostAddress}}/events/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111/tickets/{{ticketId}}/availability
Accept: application/json

### 6. Purchase that seat (SP-05 / SP-06). Same key again -> 200 replay; new key -> 409.
POST {{BookingService.Api_HostAddress}}/events/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111/tickets/{{ticketId}}/purchase
Content-Type: application/json
X-Idempotency-Key: aaaaaaaa-bbbb-cccc-dddd-eeeeeeeeeeee

{
  "fullName": "Jane Doe",
  "email": "jane.doe@example.com"
}
